        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Intro",
            "id": 118687,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bazen, bir konuğun akşam yemeği rezervasyonunu 30 dakika ileri alması gerektiğinde olduğu gibi, mevcut tablo girdilerini güncellememiz gerekir.</p><p>SQLite'ta bunu nasıl yapabileceğimize bir göz atalım!</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Intro II",
            "id": 118688,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aynı ad altında yinelenen rezervasyonlarımız olacağından yeni bir tablo girdisini yalnızca <code>INSERT</code> etmek istemiyoruz. Bu kafa karıştırıcı olabilir!</p><p>Bir girdiyi silip yeniden eklemek de zarif bir çözüm değildir. Bunun yerine SQL'in <code>UPDATE</code> söz dizimini kullanabiliriz.</p><database visible-if=\"always\" bootstrapScript=\"CREATE TABLE `Reservations` (&#xA; `id` INTEGER NOT NULL,&#xA; `name` TEXT NOT NULL,&#xA; `phonenumber` TEXT NOT NULL,&#xA; `time` TEXT NOT NULL,&#xA; `partysize` INTEGER NOT NULL,&#xA; PRIMARY KEY (`id`)&#xA;);&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;INSERT INTO `Reservations` (`id`, `name`, `phonenumber`, `time`, `partysize`) VALUES ('1', 'Powers', '+16352637463', '18:00',4);&#xA;&#xA;INSERT INTO `Reservations` (`id`, `name`, `phonenumber`, `time`, `partysize`) VALUES ('2', 'Miranda', '+17487652839', '19:00',5);&#xA;&#xA;INSERT INTO `Reservations` (`id`, `name`, `phonenumber`, `time`, `partysize`) VALUES ('3', 'Smith', '+17648373572', '18:30',3);&#xA;\"><tables><table name=\"Reservations\"><row><header content=\"id\" /><header content=\"name\" /><header content=\"phonenumber\" /><header content=\"time\" /><header content=\"partysize\" /></row><row><data content=\"1\" /><data content=\"Powers\" /><data content=\"+16352637463\" /><data content=\"18:00\" /><data content=\"4\" /></row><row><data content=\"2\" /><data content=\"Miranda\" /><data content=\"+17487652839\" /><data content=\"19:00\" /><data content=\"5\" /></row><row><data content=\"3\" /><data content=\"Smith\" /><data content=\"+17648373572\" /><data content=\"18:30\" /><data content=\"3\" /></row></table></tables></database><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"UPDATE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Reservations \" /><text value=\"SET\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"time\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\" = \" /><text value=\"'19:00'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"WHERE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" = \" /><text value=\"'Smith'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"SELECT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" * \" /><text value=\"FROM\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Reservations;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"6\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><table name=\"Result\"><row><header content=\"id\" /><header content=\"name\" /><header content=\"phonenumber\" /><header content=\"time\" /><header content=\"partysize\" /></row><row><data content=\"1\" /><data content=\"Powers\" /><data content=\"+16352637463\" /><data content=\"18:00\" /><data content=\"4\" /></row><row><data content=\"2\" /><data content=\"Miranda\" /><data content=\"+17487652839\" /><data content=\"19:00\" /><data content=\"5\" /></row><row><data content=\"3\" /><data content=\"Smith\" /><data content=\"+17648373572\" /><data content=\"19:00\" /><data content=\"3\" /></row></table></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>UPDATE</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Limitations",
            "id": 118690,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>UPDATE</code>, bir tabloya yeni kayıtlar eklemek için kullanılamaz. Yalnızca mevcut kayıtları değiştirmek için kullanılabilir.</p><p>Örneğin, aşağıdaki <code>UPDATE</code> ifadesini çalıştırmak hiçbir veriyi değiştirmez; çünkü tabloda henüz <code>id</code> değeri 4 olan bir satır bulunmuyor.</p><database visible-if=\"always\" bootstrapScript=\"CREATE TABLE `Reservations` (&#xA; `id` INTEGER NOT NULL,&#xA; `name` TEXT NOT NULL,&#xA; `phonenumber` TEXT NOT NULL,&#xA; `time` TEXT NOT NULL,&#xA; `partysize` INTEGER NOT NULL,&#xA; PRIMARY KEY (`id`)&#xA;);&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;INSERT INTO `Reservations` (`id`, `name`, `phonenumber`, `time`, `partysize`) VALUES ('1', 'Powers', '+16352637463', '18:00',4);&#xA;&#xA;INSERT INTO `Reservations` (`id`, `name`, `phonenumber`, `time`, `partysize`) VALUES ('2', 'Miranda', '+17487652839', '19:00',5);&#xA;&#xA;INSERT INTO `Reservations` (`id`, `name`, `phonenumber`, `time`, `partysize`) VALUES ('3', 'Smith', '+17648373572', '18:30',3);&#xA;\"><tables><table name=\"Reservations\"><row><header content=\"id\" /><header content=\"name\" /><header content=\"phonenumber\" /><header content=\"time\" /><header content=\"partysize\" /></row><row><data content=\"1\" /><data content=\"Powers\" /><data content=\"+16352637463\" /><data content=\"18:00\" /><data content=\"4\" /></row><row><data content=\"2\" /><data content=\"Miranda\" /><data content=\"+17487652839\" /><data content=\"19:00\" /><data content=\"5\" /></row><row><data content=\"3\" /><data content=\"Smith\" /><data content=\"+17648373572\" /><data content=\"18:30\" /><data content=\"3\" /></row></table></tables></database><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"UPDATE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Reservations \" /><text value=\"SET\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" = \" /><text value=\"'Kelly'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"WHERE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"id\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" = \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"SELECT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" * \" /><text value=\"FROM\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Reservations;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"52\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><table name=\"Result\"><row><header content=\"id\" /><header content=\"name\" /><header content=\"phonenumber\" /><header content=\"time\" /><header content=\"partysize\" /></row><row><data content=\"1\" /><data content=\"Powers\" /><data content=\"+16352637463\" /><data content=\"18:00\" /><data content=\"4\" /></row><row><data content=\"2\" /><data content=\"Miranda\" /><data content=\"+17487652839\" /><data content=\"19:00\" /><data content=\"5\" /></row><row><data content=\"3\" /><data content=\"Smith\" /><data content=\"+17648373572\" /><data content=\"18:30\" /><data content=\"3\" /></row></table></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>WHERE</code>, ardından <code>id</code> ve sonra <code>=</code>, <code>4</code>, <code>;</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Syntax",
            "id": 118691,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir <code>UPDATE</code> ifadesi her zaman <code>UPDATE</code> anahtar sözcüğüyle başlar ve ardından tablo adı gelir.</p><p>Ardından tablo adını <code>SET</code> anahtar sözcüğü ve bir sütunu belirtilen bir değere ayarlayan bir ifade izler. Bunun nasıl göründüğüne bakalım!</p><database visible-if=\"always\" bootstrapScript=\"CREATE TABLE `Directory` (&#xA; `floor` INTEGER NOT NULL,&#xA; `company` TEXT NOT NULL,&#xA; PRIMARY KEY (`floor`)&#xA;);&#xA;&#xA;INSERT INTO `Directory` (`floor`, `company`) VALUES (1, 'Lobby');&#xA;&#xA;INSERT INTO `Directory` (`floor`, `company`) VALUES (2, 'Perkins Legal');&#xA;&#xA;INSERT INTO `Directory` (`floor`, `company`) VALUES (3, '(Vacant)');&#xA;&#xA;INSERT INTO `Directory` (`floor`, `company`) VALUES (4, 'Bright Whites Dental');&#xA;&#xA;INSERT INTO `Directory` (`floor`, `company`) VALUES (5, 'Whiz Kid IT Support');\"><tables><table name=\"Directory\"><row><header content=\"floor\" /><header content=\"company\" /></row><row><data content=\"1\" /><data content=\"Lobby\" /></row><row><data content=\"2\" /><data content=\"Perkins Legal\" /></row><row><data content=\"3\" /><data content=\"(Vacant)\" /></row><row><data content=\"4\" /><data content=\"Bright Whites Dental\" /></row><row><data content=\"5\" /><data content=\"Whiz Kid IT Support\" /></row></table></tables></database><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"UPDATE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Directory\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"SET\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" company = \" /><text value=\"'Smith Tax &amp; Audit'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"SELECT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" * \" /><text value=\"FROM\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Directory\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"6\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><table name=\"Result\"><row><header content=\"floor\" /><header content=\"company\" /></row><row><data content=\"1\" /><data content=\"Smith Tax &amp; Audit\" /></row><row><data content=\"2\" /><data content=\"Smith Tax &amp; Audit\" /></row><row><data content=\"3\" /><data content=\"Smith Tax &amp; Audit\" /></row><row><data content=\"4\" /><data content=\"Smith Tax &amp; Audit\" /></row><row><data content=\"5\" /><data content=\"Smith Tax &amp; Audit\" /></row></table></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>UPDATE</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "One Row",
            "id": 118694,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Muhtemelen fark ettiğin gibi, <code>UPDATE</code> her satır için bir sütunun değerini güncellemek amacıyla kullanılabilir, ancak çoğu zaman belirli bir satırı değiştirmek isteriz.</p><p>Bunu, <code>UPDATE</code> ifademizin sonuna bir <code>WHERE</code> yan tümcesi ekleyerek yapabiliriz.</p><database visible-if=\"always\" bootstrapScript=\"CREATE TABLE `Directory` (&#xA; `floor` INTEGER NOT NULL,&#xA; `company` TEXT NOT NULL,&#xA; PRIMARY KEY (`floor`)&#xA;);&#xA;&#xA;INSERT INTO `Directory` (`floor`, `company`) VALUES (1, 'Lobby');&#xA;&#xA;INSERT INTO `Directory` (`floor`, `company`) VALUES (2, 'Perkins Legal');&#xA;&#xA;INSERT INTO `Directory` (`floor`, `company`) VALUES (3, '(Vacant)');&#xA;&#xA;INSERT INTO `Directory` (`floor`, `company`) VALUES (4, 'Bright Whites Dental');&#xA;&#xA;INSERT INTO `Directory` (`floor`, `company`) VALUES (5, 'Whiz Kid IT Support');\"><tables><table name=\"Directory\"><row><header content=\"floor\" /><header content=\"company\" /></row><row><data content=\"1\" /><data content=\"Lobby\" /></row><row><data content=\"2\" /><data content=\"Perkins Legal\" /></row><row><data content=\"3\" /><data content=\"(Vacant)\" /></row><row><data content=\"4\" /><data content=\"Bright Whites Dental\" /></row><row><data content=\"5\" /><data content=\"Whiz Kid IT Support\" /></row></table></tables></database><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"UPDATE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Directory\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"SET\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" company = \" /><text value=\"'Smith Tax &amp; Audit'\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"WHERE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"floor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"SELECT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" * \" /><text value=\"FROM\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Directory\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"57\" /><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"65\" /><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"67\" /><option startIndex=\"67\" endIndex=\"68\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><table name=\"Result\"><row><header content=\"floor\" /><header content=\"company\" /></row><row><data content=\"1\" /><data content=\"Lobby\" /></row><row><data content=\"2\" /><data content=\"Perkins Legal\" /></row><row><data content=\"3\" /><data content=\"Smith Tax &amp; Audit\" /></row><row><data content=\"4\" /><data content=\"Bright Whites Dental\" /></row><row><data content=\"5\" /><data content=\"Whiz Kid IT Support\" /></row></table></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>WHERE</code>, ardından <code>floor</code> ve sonra <code>=</code>, <code>3</code>, <code>;</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Multiple Rows",
            "id": 118695,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>WHERE</code> yan tümcesine bir koşul eklemek, <code>UPDATE</code> deyimimizdeki koşulumuzu aynı anda sağlayan birden fazla satırı güncellememize olanak tanır.</p><p>Örneğin, 6 saat veya daha uzun tüm uçuşlar için <code>mealservice</code> sütununu <code>True</code> ile doldurmak istediğimizi düşün.</p><database visible-if=\"always\" bootstrapScript=\"CREATE TABLE `Flights` (&#xA; `number` TEXT NOT NULL,&#xA; `type` TEXT NOT NULL,&#xA; `origin` TEXT NOT NULL,&#xA; `destination` TEXT NOT NULL,&#xA; `duration` REAL NOT NULL,&#xA; `mealservice` INTEGER,&#xA; PRIMARY KEY (`number`)&#xA;);&#xA;&#xA;INSERT INTO `Flights` (`number`, `type`, `origin`, `destination`, `duration`) VALUES ('PA84', 'International', 'Paris', 'London', 1.2);&#xA;&#xA;INSERT INTO `Flights` (`number`, `type`, `origin`, `destination`, `duration`) VALUES ('PA56', 'Domestic', 'New York', 'Los Angeles', 5.5);&#xA;&#xA;INSERT INTO `Flights` (`number`, `type`, `origin`, `destination`, `duration`) VALUES ('PA67', 'International', 'New York', 'London', 7);&#xA;&#xA;INSERT INTO `Flights` (`number`, `type`, `origin`, `destination`, `duration`) VALUES ('PA76', 'Domestic', 'Honolulu', 'Boston', 9.5);\"><tables><table name=\"Flights\"><row><header content=\"number\" /><header content=\"type\" /><header content=\"origin\" /><header content=\"destination\" /><header content=\"duration\" /><header content=\"mealservice\" /></row><row><data content=\"PA84\" /><data content=\"International\" /><data content=\"Paris\" /><data content=\"London\" /><data content=\"1.2\" /><data content=\"\" /></row><row><data content=\"PA56\" /><data content=\"Domestic\" /><data content=\"New York\" /><data content=\"Los Angeles\" /><data content=\"5.5\" /><data content=\"\" /></row><row><data content=\"PA67\" /><data content=\"International\" /><data content=\"New York\" /><data content=\"London\" /><data content=\"7.0\" /><data content=\"\" /></row><row><data content=\"PA76\" /><data content=\"Domestic\" /><data content=\"Honolulu\" /><data content=\"Boston\" /><data content=\"9.5\" /><data content=\"\" /></row></table></tables></database><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"UPDATE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Flights \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"SET\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" mealservice = \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"WHERE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"duration\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" &gt;= \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"SELECT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" * \" /><text value=\"FROM\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Flights;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"57\" /><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"60\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><table name=\"Result\"><row><header content=\"number\" /><header content=\"type\" /><header content=\"origin\" /><header content=\"destination\" /><header content=\"duration\" /><header content=\"mealservice\" /></row><row><data content=\"PA84\" /><data content=\"International\" /><data content=\"Paris\" /><data content=\"London\" /><data content=\"1.2\" /><data content=\"\" /></row><row><data content=\"PA56\" /><data content=\"Domestic\" /><data content=\"New York\" /><data content=\"Los Angeles\" /><data content=\"5.5\" /><data content=\"\" /></row><row><data content=\"PA67\" /><data content=\"International\" /><data content=\"New York\" /><data content=\"London\" /><data content=\"7.0\" /><data content=\"1\" /></row><row><data content=\"PA76\" /><data content=\"Domestic\" /><data content=\"Honolulu\" /><data content=\"Boston\" /><data content=\"9.5\" /><data content=\"1\" /></row></table></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>WHERE</code>, ardından <code>duration</code> ve sonra <code>&gt;=</code>, <code>6</code>, <code>;</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Intro II",
            "id": 118697,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mevcut bir tablo girdisini değiştirmek için hangisi daha zarif çözümdür?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>UPDATE</code> ifadesini kullanma</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Bir <code>DELETE</code> ifadesinin ardından bir <code>INSERT</code> ifadesi kullanma</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>UPDATE</code> ifadesini kullanma.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir kullanıcı e-posta adresini değiştiriyor ancak mevcut tablo satırı ve diğer değerleri aynı kalmalı. Hangi çözüm bu göreve uyar?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>UPDATE</code> ifadesini kullanma</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Bir <code>DELETE</code> ifadesinin ardından bir <code>INSERT</code> ifadesi kullanma</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Aynı kullanıcı kimliğiyle bir <code>INSERT</code> ifadesi kullanmak</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>UPDATE</code> ifadesini kullanma öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Limitations",
            "id": 118698,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>UPDATE</code> yeni kayıtları bir tabloya eklemek için kullanılabilir mi?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Hayır, <code>UPDATE</code> yalnızca mevcut kayıtları değiştirmek için kullanılabilir</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Evet, SQLite otomatik olarak yeni bir kayıt oluşturur</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Hayır, <code>UPDATE</code> yalnızca mevcut kayıtları değiştirmek için kullanılabilir.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir <code>UPDATE</code>, <code>42</code> kimlikli kullanıcıyı hedefliyor ancak bu kimlik tabloda yok. İfade <code>42</code> kimlikli kullanıcıyı ekler mi?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Hayır, <code>UPDATE</code> yalnızca eşleşen mevcut bir girdiyi değiştirebilir</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Evet, SQLite değiştirilen değerlerden <code>42</code> kimlikli kullanıcıyı oluşturur</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Evet, ancak yalnızca <code>42</code> sonraki kullanılabilir kullanıcı kimliğiyse</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Hayır, <code>UPDATE</code> yalnızca eşleşen mevcut bir girdiyi değiştirebilir.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Syntax",
            "id": 118699,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>UPDATE</code> ifadesinin temel söz dizimi hangi anahtar kelimelerle başlar?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">  Değiştirilecek tablonun adının ardından <code>UPDATE</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">  Değiştirilecek sütunun adıyla birlikte <code>UPDATE</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">  Değiştirilecek tablonun adının ardından <code>UPDATE</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>users</code> tablosundaki <code>email</code> sütununu değiştirmen gerekiyor. Hangi başlangıç güncellenecek tabloyu doğru belirtir?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>UPDATE users</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>UPDATE email</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>UPDATE users.email</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>UPDATE users</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: One Row",
            "id": 118700,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Yalnızca belirli bir veri satırını değiştirmek istiyorsan ne eklemelisin?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Bir <code>WHERE</code> yan tümcesi</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Sütun adı ve yeni değer</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Bir <code>WHERE</code> yan tümcesi.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Yalnızca <code>id</code> değeri <code>7</code> olan satırın puanını değiştirmek istiyorsun. <code>UPDATE</code> ne içermeli?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Bir <code>WHERE id = 7</code> ifadesi</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Yalnızca puan sütunu ve yeni değeri</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Bir <code>ON id = 7</code> ifadesi</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Bir <code>WHERE id = 7</code> ifadesi öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Multiple Rows",
            "id": 118701,
            "contentType": "interactive",
